    "Nansen was not connected. smartWalletCount and kolCount are null so the UI shows an em dash; never write 0 to mean missing.",
    "Ages on smartFlows are as last read during the scroll capture; the same wallet+action+token+usd row can show a drifted age on later passes, so ages are approximate. A Paused indicator appeared when the mouse was over the board; it was not used as a reason to drop rows. Screenshots: trending.png (Solana 1h Trending table ~10:20 PM ET), token-info-crop.png (slightly earlier Token Info chips), inflow.png through inflow-4.png (Smart Inflow scroll passes).",
    "Trending top 10 and Token Info percentages were taken from a signed-in GMGN Solana 1h Trending table at https://gmgn.ai/trend?chain=sol (Trending tab, 1h) around 10:20 PM ET and checked against trending.png. price was not shown on the table (stored null). Token Info icons, confirmed on the screenshot: green-person % = top10Pct, red-rat % = insiderPct, green-sniper % = sniperPct. Visible 0% values are stored as 0. The first capture pass had mapped insider to the 4th line-1 chip; those values were corrected from the red-rat chip on trending.png. Other Token Info chips (DS, lock, bundler/bot %, Unpaid, CTO, tax) are not in this schema and were not stored as risk flags; no honeypot, mint, or freeze badges were visible on the top 10.",
    "trending.png figures matched the stored top 10 in the same order after the insider correction: GOOBIE (7B72…pump) MC $49.3K / +2K% / holders 377 / vol $186.9K / top10 25% / insider 4% / sniper 0%; GROKIA (3cL4…pump) $1.4M / +270.7% / 2.2K / $1.2M / 27% / 0% / 0%; Flatulence (Gq2A…pump) $116.7K / -15.3% / 1.9K / $713.9K / 20% / 19% / 0%; FATU (3reE…pump) $30.9K / +402.3% / 440 / $74.6K / 18% / 2% / 0.16%; FART (x1Ns…pump) $14.7K / -48.5% / 417 / $144.3K / 23% / 16% / 0%; DIPWHEELER (AYVg…pump) $10.3K / +351.4% / 195 / $88.9K / 27% / 13% / 2.44%; FATU (9MfN…pump) $2.2K / -23.7% / 61 / $81.6K / 9% / 0% / 18.82%; catalyst (4n7r…pump) $5.3K / +101.1% / 73 / $72.6K / 21% / 4% / 10.53%; TURKEY (7C3b…pump) $7.5K / -47.2% / 217 / $83.9K / 27% / 3% / 0%; CHIBI (3mEP…vdaK) $16.7K / +418% / 180 / $59.5K / 18% / 5% / 6.31%. Some display names were truncated with ... on GMGN and were stored that way. Two different FATU mints are both in the top 10.",
    "smartFlows are 1h per-wallet Smart Inflow card rows from https://gmgn.ai/monitor?chain=sol&tab=smartdegen (Monitor > Smart, 1h), not the left-rail Smart Degen feed or Smart Net Inflow aggregates. usd is the signed 1h net inflow GMGN displayed; some Sell All/Sell Partial rows are still positive (and a few First Buy rows negative) because that column is 1h net, not the last fill — values were stored as shown, not sign-flipped. 130 distinct rows were captured across 56 token cards and 5 scroll steps; the board may have had more cards beyond that. One TRUMP Sell Partial row showed a tiny scientific-notation amount that could not be parsed confidently, so its usd is null.",
    "walletFull (complete base58) was recorded only when GMGN exposed it (wallet link href, copy button, hover, or equivalent). None of the 130 card rows exposed a full address in the DOM, so walletFull is omitted on every row. Full addresses were not guessed from abbreviations. Some wallet labels are names (dv, Maken, Doji, mrgrinch, GorillaPanic, 9527, and a RWAINU label with emoji) rather than prefix…suffix abbreviations. tokenCaAbbrev is included to disambiguate reused tickers; last-4 characters were filled only when visible on the inflow screenshots.",
    "Accumulation (multiple distinct smart wallets with First Buy and/or Buy More on the same token): CUNTS (7CvW...) (3 wallets); Flatulence (Gq2A...pump) (3 wallets); hSOL (he1i...tn9A) (3 wallets); mihao (4Cxj...pump) (3 wallets); Redact (reda...aQQZ) (3 wallets); CATE (Ai66...pump) (2 wallets); CHIBI (3mEP...vdaK) (2 wallets); Donbei&Otsuy... (71ur...) (2 wallets); FLOG (CGJU...pump) (2 wallets); HELIE (2G8k...JoBM) (2 wallets); hello (2Lw9...) (2 wallets); MCAT (BzPy...) (2 wallets); Mogmas (Cocr...) (2 wallets); NVDAx (Xsc9...9dEh) (2 wallets); OnOne (6rq1...) (2 wallets); RingRoll (46VG...) (2 wallets).",
